              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yakobo, “Nyoh ghanyi asheeda aga habeawooda.” Hean ghwaak habeawooda, ak ghwashaayda hawundaanyi bea jeata ak ghoadaw Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
